From 238052a717d3be9b5967ea3cdf4e3a16971c14ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel de Jesus Cuauhtemoc Espinoza Calderon <miguel.espinoza@ciateq.mx>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 19:16:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Show projected Kt/V during therapy and save delivered
 dose on stop

The dialysis label keeps its text and now reads ktv_projectado while the
session runs. Leaving the session closes the open interval with the
current dialysance and stores that delivered Kt/V. The correction test
uses a real second D of 100 mL/min, so the 80 min stop is 0.30.
---
